; canary-C — control flow only (NOP / INC / RET chain; W-START attempt-N5b)
; H_00:  INC state[0x50]    (state[0x50] was 0, becomes 1)
;        INC state[0x50]    (becomes 2)
;        INC state[0x50]    (becomes 3)
;        RET
; Expected: clean HALT, rax = 3 (or state[0x50] = 3 in the Mmu).
; This canary is the GREEN canary — it has no NULL deref and no
; platform op. Verifier byte-equality: identical to G-SM-INC
; chained thrice. Used to baseline the emulator's correctness
; against the W-SM-INC fixture (single-INC variant).
40 00
  66 50
  66 50
  66 50
  FF
